{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1120609001:0":{"text":"これは……どこでこれを？","source_cn":"这手稿……你们是在哪里找到的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDF29A0F5B70E866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120609002:0":{"text":"我々がさっき倒した盗賊が持っていました。何が書かれているのですか？","source_cn":"就在刚才被我们打倒的盗匪身上。这手稿上写的是什么啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CFE2843604465AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120609003:0":{"text":"私も解読できませんでした。ほとんどの文字が汚れて読めないうえに、読める文字もわざと順番がバラバラに書かれています！まるで暗号文です……","source_cn":"漫漫也读不懂。很多字都模糊不清，能看清楚的那些还被刻意...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D49E38279B1BBB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120609004:1":{"text":"この筆跡と暗号化の方法……これはもしかして……アウェン、これを見ろ！","source_cn":"这字迹和加密方式……这该不会是……艾文，你快来看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ABE36F281B84A6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120609005:0":{"text":"えっ！？まさか！！","source_cn":"什么？！这怎么可能？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC00CA60173AFBC2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120609006:0":{"text":"ん？どうしました？このメモがどうかしたのですか？","source_cn":"嗯？你们在说什么？这张手稿有什么不对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AEDEF021F3E38C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120609007:0":{"text":"この文字……父の筆跡にそっくりなんです！","source_cn":"我们是说，这字迹……像是我们父亲的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4CA4D7EFFF75F72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120609008:0":{"text":"えっ？まさか！","source_cn":"啊？不会这么巧吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA71B490C7C0E864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120609009:0":{"text":"私たちの父もトレジャーハンターでした。最後に宝を探しに向かったのが風食の飛地で、そのまま消息を絶っています……","source_cn":"我们的父亲也是名宝藏猎人，他最后一次寻宝就是来风蚀飞地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45A90E87E617F1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120609010:0":{"text":"近所の人たちがコソコソと話していました。父は僕らを捨てたんだと。でも僕らには信じられませんでした。父は絶対にそんな人間ではありません！","source_cn":"邻居总会悄悄地议论，说父亲抛弃了我们。欧迪尔和我都不相...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53D823254A4DDDF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120609011:1":{"text":"……そのこともあって、私はこの仕事を好きになれませんでした。ですが、だからといって他にできることもありません。","source_cn":"……因为父亲的关系，我并不喜欢做这一行，可我也不知道自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3C452FA314408E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120609012:1":{"text":"僕はトレジャーハンターになるべきだと思っていました。お金が手に入るし、父親の居場所を探し出せるかもしれないからです。","source_cn":"我倒是觉得当个宝藏猎人挺不错的，能发财，说不定还能找到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F74EAC7AC5DB122","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1120609012":{"text":"僕はトレジャーハンターになるべきだと思っていました。お金が手に入るし、父親の居場所を探し出せるかもしれないからです。","source_cn":"我倒是觉得当个宝藏猎人挺不错的，能发财，说不定还能找到父亲的踪迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F74EAC7AC5DB122","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120609013:1":{"text":"たしかにこのメモは父を見つけるためのヒントになるかもしれません……これがここにあるということは父がこの辺りに来たということです。","source_cn":"的确，这份手稿或许是我们找到父亲的契机……这说明他一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x578F5A1F42716D2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120609014:1":{"text":"ですがメモはこの通り。いったい何が書かれているのか……","source_cn":"可手稿上面的字已经模糊不清了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED62654F0A394F0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_